Reading: gamma_c(R) is the NECESSARY-condition floor at finite R.  Any
construction rate must be >= it.  If the empirical construction threshold
gamma_R equals gamma_c(R), the construction is TIGHT against the necessary
condition; if gamma_R is stuck at 3/5 while gamma_c(R) is well below, the
gap is a CONSTRUCTION deficiency, not a capacity one.
